      "Recommends image, font, preload, and critical CSS fixes.",
      "Shows React and Next.js patterns for reducing input latency.",
      "Provides CLS prevention patterns for media, dynamic content, fonts, and animation.",
      "Includes Lighthouse CI and performance budget examples.",
      "Offers a quick review checklist for performance work."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Does not run Lighthouse or collect field data by itself.",
      "Examples use placeholder URLs and require project-specific replacement.",
